  "details": "after logging in, the game tries to load into the home world but it remains at 0.00 B/ 0.00 B and loops 3 times. when i can finally click on the go button, i am sent to the error world. none of the world images/avatars are visible to me and trying to load into a different world/restarting vrchat changes nothing. \ni've tried reinstalling, clearing cache, running with admin, as well as every solution i could find online multiple times. i still haven't been able to get a different result whatsoever. i've been playing vrchat for years and have never encountered this problem until after the april 23 avatar update.\n(i play vrchat on desktop and quest with link)",
